{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7d7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b8","comment":"此一局形与第4轮童本平对许银川一样,只是小孙将炮八平六改为马八进九,可阻止黑右车出动,实战效果要好些.而黑棋退炮迂回,有限制红方炮八平六之用.","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0a1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a1d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"进车卒线,没有明显作用.如笔者走棋,定要走车二进四巡河,随时可以兵三进一邀兑,开通马路方显实在.","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1d3","comment":"又是一步作用不明显的棋.此时仍应走兵三进一,卒7进1,车二平三,开通马路.","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3f5","comment":"红进炮虽显笨拙,但很不要,否则黑可车1平2 兑炮抢占通线,红方不舒服.黑方退车稳,如车6进2,士四进五,车6平7,车二退四,车1平2,炮八进五,车2退1,车六进一,以后兑三兵,形势平淡.","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b8b9","comment":"也许小许已经察觉,在僵持的局面中,双方都一时难以找到主攻方向,因而这一手退炮,是在作&quot;内务&quot;调整.如果直接卒3进1打通3线亦可。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i2i6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7i6","comment":"红方进炮吃卒，不甘寂寞，如果忍让，可走车二退二，形势仍然难以突破。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6i6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a4a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i6e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9d9","comment":"小孙毅然吃中卒，不畏强敌，颇有气度。稳健一点，可走车一退二，加强应有的防范。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6h6","comment":"再有勇气，红也不敢车五平七吃卒了，因接着车6平2，炮八进二，车2退3，红无法同时防范黑前炮平一和炮4进7轰底士的凶着。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d7a7","comment":"急切之中平炮打马，笔者颇难理解，为何不走车1平3吃兵？红似乎只有车六进一，以下前炮平1，车六平四，炮1进1，车二进二，马4进5，红方受攻击十分明显，黑棋占优。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a5b5","comment":"红兵七平八妙手解围。黑此时如车2进3，则车六进五，炮1进5，相七进九，车2进1，相九退七，局势简化，黑虽易下，但取胜难度极大。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9d3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b8a8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7a6","comment":"看得出小勇征战斗热情颇高，如走车二平六交换，和势甚浓。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d3g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i3i4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i4i5","comment":"进入三马炮残棋决斗，冷静分析，当属均势，红方稍显乐观。\r\n27着进兵不如炮九退二先防黑马出击，黑卒3进1，红兵五进一，双方各有牵制。而红方第二次进边兵，仍宜改为炮九退二。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d8e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4c6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a5b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a8a9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8d7","comment":"行棋至此，红方局势已处下风。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6a7","comment":"进马求攻，过高估计自己力量，对整个形势判断过于兴奋。应该马二进四，以后可退炮防守，方为良策。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1d2","comment":"当局势稍处下风之时，红方显得沉不住气了。匆匆进马，毫无目的，应马九退八，以利退炮防守，双方的较量还会漫长，胜负也一时难以预料。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3i3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2e4","comment":"红方一味盲动强攻，应士四进五，黑如马6进8，红兵五进一，还可以全力防守。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i3e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e0d0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3i5","comment":"红方强攻无功而返，过河兵又被歼灭，鸡飞蛋打一场空，败势已成。年轻选手都应该从这一结果总结经验教训，方有利于棋艺的成熟。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i5h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a4a3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8f9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7c9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{